1
00:00:00,677 --> 00:00:02,177
(Stuart:)Thanks, Leonard.

2
00:00:02,345 --> 00:00:03,925
(Stuart:)What is that thing anyway?

3
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:06,516
(Howard:)You don't know what this is?

4
00:00:06,683 --> 00:00:08,643
(Leonard:)- No.
- Good, get out.

5
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:15,860
(Raj:)Be afraid of Penny. Nice, very crafty.

6
00:00:16,026 --> 00:00:20,776
(Leonard:)It wasn't bad advice.
It just wasn't particularly helpful.

7
00:00:21,281 --> 00:00:25,201
(Sheldon:)For what it's worth, my mother says
that when we deceive for personal gain...

8
00:00:25,368 --> 00:00:27,618
(Sheldon:)...we make Jesus cry.

9
00:00:35,337 --> 00:00:41,297
(Sheldon:)All right, what if we use this two-inch PVC
to reinforce the center cross-support?

10
00:00:41,468 --> 00:00:44,848
(Howard:)No good. I mean, it might work
for the Japanese and the Americans...

11
00:00:45,013 --> 00:00:48,053
(Howard:)...but have you seen the size
of the Russians they got up there?

12
00:00:50,602 --> 00:00:55,602
(Howard:)This thing has to hold up
against a hearty potato-based diet.

13
00:00:56,149 --> 00:00:57,859
(Leonard:)I feel terrible.

14
00:00:58,026 --> 00:01:01,276
(Howard:)Maybe if you were helping,
you'd feel better about yourself.

